+# PATHCHECK — three receipt-only checks
+
+`DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_CLAIM`. This is a static file, JSON, arithmetic, and digest audit. No physics evaluation, tape build, catalogue construction, search, or Python process was run. No sealed file was changed. Loss values are not used as evidence about EE.
