+| 8 | 21.283354563580243 | -21.283354563580243 | -2107.052101794444 | 4.787895131997764 | inside |
+| 12 | -3.538884173327756 | 3.538884173327756 | 350.34953315944784 | 0.7961060017847883 | inside |
+| 16 | 4.453836454679034 | -4.453836454679034 | -440.92980901322437 | 1.0019333097312628 | inside; magnitude is 0.85080901322437 κ above `440.079` |
+| 20 | -12.496824496221407 | 12.496824496221407 | 1237.1856251259194 | 2.811280758968093 | inside |
+| 24 | 8.693742188904839 | -8.693742188904839 | -860.680476701579 | 1.955740848124039 | inside |
+| 28 | -13.2449027654574 | 13.2449027654574 | 1311.2453737802825 | 2.9795681543093 | inside |
+
+The sampled absolute artefact envelope is `127.22275335893558` to `2107.052101794444` κ. The reported `|Psi| = 440.079` is inside it; four sampled signs (steps 4, 8, 16, and 24) also match the reported negative `Psi`, and step 16 alone is essentially the same magnitude. Seven of eight absolute propagated offsets lie inside C3REACH's recorded exact-Ψ range; the smallest misses its lower endpoint by only `0.47178885446423` κ. The `+480.113 / -440.079 / +40.034` cancellation is therefore **inside the artefact envelope**, not outside or indeterminate.
